_build/

# Generated demo video binaries — regenerated by `pnpm demo:encode`.
# The Plone File metadata (data.json) is committed. The real capture is not —
# it is megabytes — but a tiny STAND-IN mp4 is (one second of black, 32x32), so
# the fixture's @@download/file resolves in a fresh checkout and the tests that
# assert media sources exist can tell a dead reference from a big one.
# Recapture replaces the stand-in before deploy.
_static/hydra-demo.mp4
